{"id":4534,"date":"2025-10-30T09:00:00","date_gmt":"2025-10-30T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=4534"},"modified":"2025-10-29T15:55:50","modified_gmt":"2025-10-29T15:55:50","slug":"zaha-hadid-architects-and-thornhill-primary-design-a-flood-resilient-islington-for-2050","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/zaha-hadid-architects-and-thornhill-primary-design-a-flood-resilient-islington-for-2050\/","title":{"rendered":"Zaha Hadid Architects and Thornhill Primary School Design a Flood-Resilient Islington for 2050"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-cd2d3fc\" data-block-id=\"cd2d3fc\"><style>.stk-cd2d3fc {margin-bottom:19px !important;}<\/style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-4529 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Untitled-1-scaled.png\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1810\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Untitled-1-scaled.png 2560w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Untitled-1-300x212.png 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Untitled-1-1024x724.png 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Untitled-1-768x543.png 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Untitled-1-1536x1086.png 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Untitled-1-2048x1448.png 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Untitled-1-283x200.png 283w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Untitled-1-177x125.png 177w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2560px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2560\/1810;\" \/><\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Zaha Hadid Architects (ZHA), the international multi-award-winning practice, returned to Thornhill Primary School this summer. Their mission: to reimagine the local neighbourhood as a flood-resistant, resilient community in the year 2050.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Over five weeks, ZHA\u2019s Jennifer Durand and Nurul Fauzi guided the children from an abstract concept to a professional presentation of their ideas. The project began with the 9-and-10-year-olds analysing the complex relationship our cities have with water. The pivotal third week saw ideas for coping with too much and too little water take physical form, as the children translated their creative concepts drawn on whiteboards, into 3D models made from cardboard, masking tape, and straws.<br><br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-4a4e846\" data-block-id=\"4a4e846\"><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-4554 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-20-at-13.03.27.png\" width=\"1532\" height=\"872\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-20-at-13.03.27.png 1532w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-20-at-13.03.27-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-20-at-13.03.27-1024x583.png 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-20-at-13.03.27-768x437.png 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-20-at-13.03.27-351x200.png 351w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-20-at-13.03.27-200x114.png 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1532px) 100vw, 1532px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1532px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1532\/872;\" \/><\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem\"><span style=\"color: #0f0e17;\" class=\"stk-highlight\"><em>&#8220;We have to be ready&#8221; <\/em><\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:1rem\"><span style=\"color: #0f0e17;\" class=\"stk-highlight\">Year 5 child in focus group, Thornhill Primary School<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A visit to the ZHA offices offered a thrilling glimpse into the life of an architect which included presentations from the architectural experts, before the final week in the classroom dedicated to refining their plans and drawings. Armed with new knowledge and inspiration, the children worked in groups to develop their concepts, their &#8220;boundless creativity&#8221; <em>(Nurul, ZHA)<\/em> becoming the project&#8217;s driving force.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-c2c2c78\" data-block-id=\"c2c2c78\"><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-4546 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Multimedia.jpg\" width=\"1919\" height=\"1081\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Multimedia.jpg 1919w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Multimedia-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Multimedia-1024x577.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Multimedia-768x433.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Multimedia-1536x865.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Multimedia-355x200.jpg 355w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Multimedia-200x113.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1919px) 100vw, 1919px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1919px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1919\/1081;\" \/><\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8220;The children asked a lot of questions about being an architect&#8221; reflected ZHA\u2019s Jennifer Durand &#8220;I explained we have to think like engineers when solving a problem.&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The winning designs, selected by an expert panel, were then digitally elaborated by ZHA\u2019s team. In a fascinating fusion of children\u2019s imagination and cutting-edge technology, the child-groups\u2019 concepts were&nbsp;carefully studied by the ZHA team and developed further using various digital design tools before being professionally rendered.&nbsp;Special thanks is due to ZHA\u2019s&nbsp;Design&nbsp;team\u2014Clemens, Alex, Prasanna, and Yiying\u2014for demonstrating how modern technology can be a powerful tool to help us re-imagine our future.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The children were recognised with awards for&nbsp;\u2018Most Imaginative Idea\u2019, celebrating a city full of creative possibilities;&nbsp;\u2018Future Engineer Award\u2019, for engineering the cities of tomorrow; and&nbsp;\u2018Idea Expression Award\u2019, for a design with a compelling narrative.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-carousel stk-block-carousel stk--is-slide stk--arrows-justify-space-between stk--arrows-align-center stk-block stk-a50f20b\" data-slides-to-show=\"\" data-block-id=\"a50f20b\"><div class=\"stk-block-carousel__content-wrapper\"><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-block-carousel__slider-wrapper stk-content-align stk-a50f20b-column\"><div class=\"stk-block-carousel__slider\" role=\"list\" data-autoplay=\"4000\" data-label-slide-of=\"Slide %%d of %%d\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-6043dea\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"6043dea\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-6043dea {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 calc(95% - var(--stk-column-gap, 0px) * 1 \/ 2 ) !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-6043dea-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-6043dea-inner-blocks\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-b9bcaeb\" data-block-id=\"b9bcaeb\"><style>.stk-b9bcaeb .stk-img-wrapper{width:1024px !important;}<\/style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-4541 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/11.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"724\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/11.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/11-300x212.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/11-768x543.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/11-283x200.jpg 283w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/11-177x125.jpg 177w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/724;\" \/><\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-d7f671f\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"d7f671f\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-d7f671f {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 calc(5% - var(--stk-column-gap, 0px) * 1 \/ 2 ) !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-d7f671f-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-d7f671f-inner-blocks\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-5c85968\" data-block-id=\"5c85968\"><style>.stk-5c85968 .stk-img-wrapper{width:1024px !important;}<\/style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-4543 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/13.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"724\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/13.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/13-300x212.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/13-768x543.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/13-283x200.jpg 283w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/13-177x125.jpg 177w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/724;\" \/><\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"stk-block-carousel__buttons\"><button class=\"stk-block-carousel__button stk-block-carousel__button__prev\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"chevron-left\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-left\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><path d=\"M34.52 239.03L228.87 44.69c9.37-9.37 24.57-9.37 33.94 0l22.67 22.67c9.36 9.36 9.37 24.52.04 33.9L131.49 256l154.02 154.75c9.34 9.38 9.32 24.54-.04 33.9l-22.67 22.67c-9.37 9.37-24.57 9.37-33.94 0L34.52 272.97c-9.37-9.37-9.37-24.57 0-33.94z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/button><button class=\"stk-block-carousel__button stk-block-carousel__button__next\" aria-label=\"Next slide\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"chevron-right\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-right\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><path d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/button><\/div><\/div><div class=\"stk-block-carousel__dots\" role=\"list\" data-label=\"Slide %%d\"><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem\"><em>&#8220;Coming to schools helps spreads awareness.&nbsp; Doing this whole project is teaching us about climate change.&#8221; <\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:1rem\"><span style=\"color: #0f0e17;\" class=\"stk-highlight\">Year 5 child in focus group, Thornhill Primary School<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Perhaps the most powerful outcome was the sense of agency the project fostered. As one year 5 pupil from a Thornhill focus group said: \u201cDoing this project also helps [one feel less worried] because you know that there are people who care and are trying to produce things to stop climate change.&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-60e849e\" data-block-id=\"60e849e\"><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-4537 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Scene-0-2_1-scaled.png\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Scene-0-2_1-scaled.png 2560w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Scene-0-2_1-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Scene-0-2_1-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Scene-0-2_1-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Scene-0-2_1-1536x864.png 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Scene-0-2_1-2048x1152.png 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Scene-0-2_1-356x200.png 356w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Scene-0-2_1-200x113.png 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2560px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2560\/1440;\" \/><\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CCAC is delighted with the outcome of this continuing partnership and extends its gratitude to the pupils and staff of Thornhill Primary School, to Jennifer, Nurul, and the wider team at Zaha Hadid Architects for their generosity and visionary work.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem\"><em>&#8220;I often forget that people outside of architecture approach climate change from a very different perspective. Working with the children was a refreshing reminder. Seeing them take on the role of architects and urban designers to express their own ideas about living with climate change and their relationship with water was truly inspiring.&#8221;<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:1rem\">Nurul Fauzi from Zaha Hadid Architects<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>ZHA, the international multi-award-winning practice, returned to Thornhill Primary School this summer. Their mission: to reimagine the local neighbourhood as a flood-resistant, resilient community in the year 2050.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10,"featured_media":4529,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta"